      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "The base class for a platform heap implementation. Transient resources are placed on the heap at specific\nbyte offsets. Each heap additionally contains a cache of RHI transient resources, each with its own RHI\nresource and cache of RHI views. The lifetime of the resource cache is tied to the heap."
